#: common/newsengine.cpp:214
msgid ""
"<p>The program '%1' was terminated anormally.<br>This can happen if it "
"receives the SIGKILL signal.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Program '%1' je prekinut.<br>Ovo je moguće ako primi SIGKILL signal.</p>"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:229
msgid "<p>Program output:<br>%1<br>"
msgstr "<p>Izlaz programa:<br>%1<br>"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:231
msgid "An error occured while updating the news source '%1'!"
msgstr "Nastupila je greška prilikom osvježavanja izvora novosti '%1'!"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:233
msgid "KNewsTicker error"
msgstr "KNewsTicker greška"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:242
msgid "The program '%1' couldn't be started at all."
msgstr "Program '%1' nije moguče pokrenuti."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:243
msgid ""
"The program '%1' tried to read or write a file or directory which couldn't "
"be found."
msgstr ""
"Program '%1' je pokušao da čita ili piše datoteku ili direktorij koji nije "
"nađen."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:245
msgid "An error occured while the program '%1' tried to read or write data."
msgstr "Nastupila je greška dok je program '%1' probao da čita ili piše."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:247
msgid ""
"The program '%1' was passed too many arguments, please adjust the command "
"line in the configuration dialog."
msgstr "Program '%1' je primio previše argumenata, molimo pokušajte podesiti komandnu liniju u konfiguracijskom dijalogu."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:249
msgid ""
"An external system program upon which the program '%1' relied couldn't be "
"executed."
msgstr "Vanjski sistemski program koji je program '%1' tražio nije moguće pokrenuti."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:251
msgid ""
"The program '%1' tried to read or write a file or directory but lacks the "
"permission to do so."
msgstr "Program '%1' je pokušao da čita ili piše direktorij, ali mi nedostaju dozvole da to uradi."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:253
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access a device which was not available."
msgstr "Program '%1' je pokušao da pristupi uređaju koji nije dostupan.."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:255
msgid "There is no more space left on the device used by the program '%1'."
msgstr "Nema dostupnog prostora na disku '%1'."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:257
msgid "The program '%1' tried to create a temporary file on a read only file system."
msgstr ""
"Program '%1' je pokušao da napravi privremenu datoteku na "
"datotečnom sistemu koji je dostupan samo za čitanje."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:259
msgid ""
"The program '%1' tried to call a function which isn't implemented or "
"attempted to access an external resource which does not exist."
msgstr "Program '%1' je pokušao da pozove funkciju koja nije implementirana ili je pokušao da pristupi vanjskom izvoru koji ne postoji."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:262
msgid ""
"The program '%1' was unable to retrieve input data and was therefore unable "
"to return any XML data."
msgstr "Program '%1' nije u mogučnosti da pristupi ulaznim podacima i vrati XML podatke."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:264
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access a host which is not connected to a network."
msgstr "The program '%1' je pokušao da pristup računaru koji nije na mreži."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:266
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access a protocol which is not implemented."
msgstr "Program '%1' je pokušao da pristupi protokolu koji nije implementiran."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:268
msgid ""
"The program '%1' requires you to configure a destination address to retrieve "
"data from. Please refer to the documentation of the program for information "
"on how to do that."
msgstr "Program '%1' zahtjeva da konfigurišete odredišnu adresu da pokupi podatke. Molim pogledajte dokumentaciju za program."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:271
msgid ""
"The program '%1' tried to use a socket type which is not supported by this "
"system."
msgstr "Program '%1' je pokušao da koristi tip socket-a koji nije podržan od strane ovog sistema."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:273
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access an unreachable network."
msgstr "Program '%1' je pokušao da pristupi nedostupnoj mreži."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:275
msgid ""
"The network the program '%1' was trying to access dropped the connection "
"with a reset."
msgstr "Mrežni program '%1' je pokušao da pristupi propaloj konekciji."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:277
msgid "The connection of the program '%1' was reset by peer."
msgstr "Konekcija do programa '%1' je resetovana od strane servera."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:279
msgid "The connection the program '%1' was trying to establish timed out."
msgstr "Konekcija koju je program '%1' pokušao da uspostavi je istekla."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:281
msgid "The connection the program '%1' was trying to establish was refused."
msgstr "Konekcija koju je program '%1' pokušao da uspostavi je odbijena."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:283
msgid "The host the program '%1' was trying to reach is down."
msgstr "Računar kojem je program '%1' pokušao da pristupi je pao."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:285
msgid ""
"The host the program '%1' was trying to reach is unreachable, no route to "
"host."
msgstr "Računar koji je program '%1' pokušao da pristupi je nedsostupan, nema putanje do računar a"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:287
msgid ""
"KNewsTicker couldn't execute the program '%1' because its executable bit "
"wasn't set. You can mark that program as executable by executing the "
"following steps:<ul><li>Open a Konqueror window and browse to the program</"
"li><li>Click on the file with the right mouse button, and select "
"'Properties'</li><li>Open the 'Permissions' tab and make sure that the box "
"in the column 'Exec' and the row 'User' is checked to ensure that the "
"current user is allowed to execute that file.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"KNewsTicker nije mogao da pokrene program '%1' zato što bit za pokretanje nije postavljen. "
"Vi možete popraviti ovaj program tako što slijedite korake:<ul><li>Otvori Konqueror i pronađi program</"
"li><li>Pritisnite na njega desnim dugmetom od miša i odabarete 'Podešavanje'</li> "
"<li>Otvori 'Permisije' i provjerite da kutija 'Exec' za trenutnog korisnika je upaljena .</li></ul>"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:295
msgid "The program '%1' sent a bad request which wasn't understood by the server."
msgstr "Program '%1' je poslao loš zahtjev koji nije prepoznat od strane servera."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:297
msgid ""
"The program '%1' failed to issue an authorization for an area which needs "
"some form of authorization before it can be accessed."
msgstr "Program '%1' nije uspio da pokrene autorizaciju za područje koji zahtjeva neki vid autorizacije prije nego pristupanja."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:300
msgid ""
"The program '%1' aborted because it couldn't access the data without paying "
"for it."
msgstr "Program '%1' je prekinut zato što nije mogao pristupiti podacima."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:302
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access a forbidden source."
msgstr "Program '%1' je pokušao da pristupi zabranjenom izvoru."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:304
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access data which couldn't be found."
msgstr "Program '%1'je pokušao da pristupi podacima koji nisu mogli biti nađeni."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:306
msgid "The HTTP request of the program '%1' timed out."
msgstr "HTTP zahtjev od programa '%1' je istekao."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:307
msgid ""
"A server error has been encountered. It's likely that you can't do anything "
"about it."
msgstr "Greška u serveru se pojavila. Vjerovatno da vi ne možete uraditi ništa po tom pitanju."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:309
msgid ""
"The HTTP protocol version used by the program '%1' was not understood by the "
"HTTP server or source."
msgstr "HTTP protokol verzija korištena od strane programa '%1' nije prepoznata."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:311
msgid "KNewsTicker was unable to detect the exact reasons for the error."
msgstr "KNewsTicker nije u mogučnosti da otkrije razloge greške koja se pojavila."

